{"id":"wb-7-1834","name":"渌江桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"淥江橋","text":"渌江桥是一座位于中华人民共和国湖南省醴陵市的桥梁，其横跨渌水，并有引桥连接河中的状元洲，始建于宋理宗宝祐年间，曾多次毁损，今桥于民国十四年（1925年）兴建，为长约186.7米，宽8米，10孔的石拱桥，亦为湖南省境内最长的石拱古桥，中华人民共和国国务院于2013年依文物保护法公告指定为国家级文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B7%A5%E6%B1%9F%E6%A9%8B","revisionId":94496466,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94496466","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/963641ba44e7876e97dd325a.jpg","title":"Lu_River_Bridge_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lu_River_Bridge_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Lu_River_Bridge_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"H2v5o68z","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​Lu River Bridge","width":320,"height":240}}